supralinux-desktop (0.1.0~dev5) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Add xserver-xorg for the default SDDM greeter. Ubuntu's SDDM package does
    not depend on an external X server, so a clean Aurora rootfs otherwise
    reaches graphical.target with SDDM running but cannot start its display
    server.
  * Keep Plasma user-session validation Wayland-only; this X server dependency
    supports the display-manager greeter and does not add a Plasma X11 session.

 -- SupraLINUX Project <noreply@supralinux.com>  Thu, 27 Aug 2026 00:30:00 -0300

supralinux-desktop (0.1.0~dev4) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Add power-profiles-daemon so Plasma power-profile controls have a backend.
  * Add ModemManager for Plasma-NM mobile-broadband support.
  * Add rfkill and IIO sensor proxy hardware integration.
  * Add switcheroo-control as the dual-GPU D-Bus integration candidate.
  * Add Plasma's on-screen keyboard so the exposed virtual-keyboard path has a
    real backend to validate.
  * Add DrKonqi/systemd-coredump integration for KDE crash handling.
  * Add KDE SSH askpass and Qt pinentry helpers for coherent desktop credential
    prompts.
  * Keep all newly added integrations subject to clean-system and hardware tests;
    Kubuntu inclusion alone is never sufficient justification.

 -- SupraLINUX Project <noreply@supralinux.com>  Tue, 25 Aug 2026 21:18:00 -0300

supralinux-desktop (0.1.0~dev3) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Add xdg-desktop-portal-gtk as the GTK/Settings fallback alongside the KDE
    portal backend. KDE remains the intended primary Plasma portal backend.
  * Require clean Wayland tests to verify portal routing before this dependency
    is considered release-frozen.

 -- SupraLINUX Project <noreply@supralinux.com>  Tue, 25 Aug 2026 20:55:00 -0300

supralinux-desktop (0.1.0~dev2) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Expand the Aurora candidate baseline with screen-locker and SDDM KCMs.
  * Add GTK/Breeze integration for non-Qt desktop applications.
  * Add printing with Print Manager and the CUPS stack.
  * Add Samba sharing integration and KIO extras.
  * Add OpenVPN and OpenConnect NetworkManager backends.
  * Add accessibility runtime pieces (AT-SPI, Orca, Speech Dispatcher).
  * Add Plasma SMART disk-health integration.
  * Keep Discover out of the hard dependency set until Snap recommendations are
    neutralized by the SupraLINUX Snap policy package.

 -- SupraLINUX Project <noreply@supralinux.com>  Tue, 25 Aug 2026 20:18:00 -0300

supralinux-desktop (0.1.0~dev1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial development metapackage for the SupraLINUX Aurora Plasma baseline.
  * Start from Ubuntu 26.04 LTS packages without depending on kubuntu-desktop.
  * Declare the first audited core/integration dependency set for clean-VM testing.

